## 2. Explosive Ordnance & Projectile Damage Calibration

Explosives (grenades, underbarrel 40mm VOG-25 / M203 rounds, RPG-7 rockets) require distinct tuning between **visual particle effects** and **lethal kinetic damage**:

```ini
[ammo_vog-25]:identity_immunities
class               = G_F1          ; Engine projectile class
fake_grenade_name   = wpn_fake_missile
blast               = 2.8           ; Core explosive hit power (HP multiplier)
blast_r             = 6.0           ; Blast radius (meters) where damage applies
blast_impulse       = 280           ; Ragdoll physics impulse force
frags               = 25            ; Secondary shrapnel fragmentation count
frags_r             = 18.0          ; Shrapnel max dispersion distance (meters)
frag_hit            = 1.1           ; Hit power per shrapnel fragment
frag_hit_impulse    = 80            ; Impulse per fragment hit
hit_type            = explosion     ; Engine damage type (bypasses standard bullet armor)
wm_size             = 0.15          ; Wallmark impact crater size
```

> [!WARNING]
> If `blast` or `frag_hit` is set to `0.0` with only `explode_particles` defined, the projectile will produce smoke, sound, and muzzle flashes without inflicting any actual health damage on enemies.

