## 3. Durability, Jamming & Anti-Misfire Tuning

To eliminate weapon degradation, misfires, and jamming during testing or play:

```ini
; Complete Anti-Jamming & Infinite Durability Config
misfire_probability         = 0.0000    ; Chance of misfire when condition degrades
misfire_condition_k         = 0.00      ; Misfire probability multiplier per wear point
condition_shot_dec          = 0.0000    ; Durability degradation per single shot
condition_queue_shot_dec    = 0.0000    ; Durability degradation per burst shot
```

---

## 4. Slot Positioning & Equipment Mapping

Weapons belong to specific inventory slot hierarchies:
- **`slot = 1`:** Pistol / Sidearm slot.
- **`slot = 2`:** Primary Rifle / Shotgun / Heavy weapon slot.
- **`slot = 0`:** Knife / Melee slot.
- **`slot = 3`:** Grenades (throwable).

To allow a grenade launcher (such as the RG-6) to be carried as a standard primary combat rifle, set `slot = 2` and ensure `default_to_truck = false`.

---

## 5. Lua Infinite Ammo & No-Reload Runtime Hook

To guarantee continuous non-stop firing without triggering reload cycles:

```lua
-- gamedata/scripts/bind_stalker.script or weapon_callbacks.script
function on_actor_weapon_fire(wpn)
    if not wpn then return end
    -- Keep active magazine full at all times
    local mag_size = wpn:get_ammo_magsize()
    if wpn:get_ammo_in_magazine() < mag_size then
        wpn:set_ammo_elapsed(mag_size)
    end
end
```
